{
  "defaults": {
    "timeout": 60000,
    "wait": 1500,
    "chromeLaunchConfig": {
      "executablePath": "/usr/bin/google-chrome",
      "args": ["--no-sandbox", "--disable-dev-shm-usage", "--disable-gpu"],
      "ignoreHTTPSErrors": true
    },
    "standard": "WCAG2AA",
    "runners": ["axe"],
    "hideElements": "#webpack-dev-server-client-overlay, #webpack-dev-server-client-overlay-div, #emergent-badge, .__cypress-recorder, [data-pa11y-ignore]",
    "reporters": ["cli"],
    "includeNotices": false,
    "includeWarnings": true,
    "threshold": 9999,
    "viewport": {
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 900
    }
  },
  "_comment": [
    "Phase 13.4 — WCAG 2.2 AA scan config.",
    "Public marketing routes are scanned without auth. Authenticated",
    "app routes (/app/*) are NOT in this baseline run because pa11y-ci",
    "would need full Studio login automation; the public surfaces",
    "already exercise the same shared chrome (top nav, AppShell, footer)",
    "so violations there cover the structural a11y baseline.",
    "Threshold left high (9999) so the gate WARNS but never blocks merge",
    "on the first run — honest posture per the brief; tighten in 13.x+1."
  ],
  "urls": [
    "https://akki-executive.preview.emergentagent.com/",
    "https://akki-executive.preview.emergentagent.com/about",
    "https://akki-executive.preview.emergentagent.com/features",
    "https://akki-executive.preview.emergentagent.com/security",
    "https://akki-executive.preview.emergentagent.com/plans",
    "https://akki-executive.preview.emergentagent.com/enterprise",
    "https://akki-executive.preview.emergentagent.com/early-access",
    "https://akki-executive.preview.emergentagent.com/blog",
    "https://akki-executive.preview.emergentagent.com/solva",
    "https://akki-executive.preview.emergentagent.com/signin"
  ]
}
